// Dialog :
"P3213049596" "What's going on? I set off the bomb, and the only thing I saw was a light shine out from Potter's Field and a bunch of screaming Circle of Thorns! It didn't blow away any land at all!<br><br>It's Tarixus! He must have double-crossed us! The Arcano-Bomb was some sort of spirit bomb, not a real bomb at all! Hrmf. Well, this puts us right back to the drawing board..."
